#4802
Windows node gracefully shutdown
   1. Kubelet detects shutdown & handles termination
   2. Respects lifecylce events(Pre-stop, SIGTERM)
   3. Cloud-agnostic & consistent across envs
      1. kubelet on windows nodes are registered as windows service which helps detect shutdown events thru the service control pre-shutdown signal(PRESHUTDOWN)
      windows service interprets PRESHUTDOWN signal
      2.  so when node shuts down, kubelet uses the same mechanism as on linux to terminate pods
      Pre-stop hooks & SIGTERM executed
      3.  Applies grace periods
      ShutdownGracePeriod & ShutdownGracePeriodCriticalPods
      4.  Ensures smooth & consistent shutdown
      Works like Linux, cloud-agnostic
      
      - Only works for service-based Kubelet(no nssm.exe support) -- KUBELET has to be REGISTERED AS WINDOWS SERVICE
      - No graceful shutdown for power loss or forced terminations
      - to ENABLE THIS FEATURE 
      Opt-in via WindowsGracefulNodeShutdown feature gate

#4420 
Retry Generate Name
   1. Automatic retry for generateName conflicts is now stable
   2. 
   apiversion: v1
   kind: Pod
   metadata:
            generateName: my-app
K8s might create resources like my-app-r9201
    this is useful when you need multiple similar resources with unique names
   3. generateName allows 14M+ unique names pre prefix but there could be name conflicts
      1. earlier API server returned HTTP 409 Conflict
   4.  API server auto-retries name conflicts
       1.  Automatically retries upto 7 times -- no manual fix needed
       2.  If all retries fail, a transparent error is returned
  
  - Feature is controlled by RetryGenerateName feature gate

#1860
Make K8s aware of the LoadBalancer behavior
   1. ipMode gives better ExternalIP control
   2. Bypassing LoadBalancer -- Breaks TLS & PROXY protocol
   3. Fixed IP on a node -- blocks health check
   eg: scaleway, tencent cloud
   cons:
   - ipMode:Proxy may add slight latency

ipMode Option       Behaviour                                 Use Case
VIP             Blinds External IP directly to node        Faster traffic routing
Proxy         Ensure traffic goes thru LB                   TLS termination, PROXY protocol, health checks

   - Controlled by LoadBalancerIPMode feature gate